## Features

- Create, Read, Update, and Soft Delete health claim documents
- Audit columns: track author, creation date, who deleted and when
- Soft delete implementation to mark records as deleted instead of removing
- Clean REST API backend with Express and Mongoose
- Angular frontend with components for listing, creating, editing, and viewing documents
- Unit tests for backend API with Jest and in-memory MongoDB

---

## Prerequisites

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) v18 or higher
- [MongoDB](https://www.mongodb.com/) running locally or a MongoDB connection URI
- [Angular CLI](https://angular.io/cli) (for frontend development)
- npm or yarn package manager

